    },
    {
     "q": "Is membrane WFI acceptable to Health Canada and the FDA?",
     "a": "USP allows a process equivalent to distillation; Ph. Eur. 0169 allows membranes since April 2017. Confirm the route product by product with your regulatory team."
    },
    {
     "q": "Do natural health products need USP Purified Water?",
